# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/lichess/fixtures/puzzles
# Three downloaded puzzles, solved offline: one solved after a wrong try,
# one failed, one skipped, with progress kept across a restart.
expect Play the computer
tap Puzzles
wait-for 3 puzzles are waiting.
expect Download 32 puzzles
expect Resume puzzle
clean
shot puzzles-waiting
tap Resume puzzle
wait-for-id skip-puzzle
expect White
# Only the solving side's pieces can be picked up.
tap-id square-a7
expect Your piece
tap-id square-e2
expect White · e2 →
# A rook cannot move diagonally: refused, and the rook stays picked up.
tap-id square-d3
expect Illegal
expect White · e2 →
# A legal move that is not the solution is a first miss, and the puzzle
# goes on from the same position.
tap-id square-e3
expect Not it. Try again.
expect-missing e2 →
clean
shot puzzle-first-miss
# The right move plays the opponent's forced reply.
tap-id square-e2
tap-id square-e8
wait-for Opponent replied Rxe8.
clean
shot puzzle-reply
tap-id square-e1
tap-id square-e8
wait-for Solved
expect Counted only on this reader.
expect Next puzzle
clean
shot puzzle-solved
tap Next puzzle
wait-for-id skip-puzzle
expect-missing Opponent replied
# The solved puzzle stays solved after the app closes.
restart
wait-for Play the computer
tap Puzzles
wait-for 2 puzzles are waiting.
tap Resume puzzle
wait-for-id skip-puzzle
# Two wrong moves end the puzzle and name the first move.
tap-id square-a1
tap-id square-a2
expect Not it. Try again.
tap-id square-a1
tap-id square-a3
wait-for Not solved
expect The first move was R
expect-missing a1a8
clean
shot puzzle-not-solved
tap Next puzzle
wait-for-id skip-puzzle
# A puzzle for Black turns the board to Black's side. Whether the last
# puzzle's verdict follows onto it is checked in drive-puzzle-verdict.kobo.
expect Black
clean
shot puzzle-black
tap-id square-b8
expect Black · b8 →
tap Skip puzzle
wait-for Not solved
expect The first move was R
expect-missing b8b1
tap Next puzzle
# With every puzzle done, the list offers a new download and nothing to
# resume.
wait-for Download 32 puzzles
expect Every downloaded puzzle is done.
expect-missing No puzzles yet
expect-missing Resume puzzle
clean
shot puzzles-done
tap Back
wait-for Play the computer
